
### Get all games
GET http://localhost:5296/games

### Get single game by ID
GET http://localhost:5296/games/2

### Create a new game
POST http://localhost:5296/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Samba",
    "genreId": 1,
    "price": 59.99,
    "releaseDate": "2027-06-01T00:00:00"
}

### Update a game
PUT http://localhost:5296/games/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "This life no suppose strong",
    "genreId": 3,
    "price": 59.99,
    "releaseDate": "2017-03-03T00:00:00"
}

### Delete a game
DELETE http://localhost:5296/games/4


### Get all genres
GET http://localhost:5296/genres